From 43ca5399deeb2d670acb5f6fdb497c3401bfedd2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <dev@chatstand.ng>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:23:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] contact: remove Port Harcourt copy, route the form to email,
 update contact address

Outstanding work on top of 7834d64. Two parts:

1. Contact update (not previously pushed)
   - Drop every Port Harcourt mention from brand copy (Footer, AuthLayout,
     About, Careers, Contact) and from a checkout test fixture. Replacements
     are location-neutral rather than naming a different city.
   - Contact form now hands off to the device mail app via mailto: with name,
     phone-or-email and message prefilled under a generic subject. The form
     previously captured nothing: the inputs were uncontrolled and submit only
     flashed a false "Message received" banner.
   - Contact address is now trewallaffiliates@gmail.com (Contact + Privacy).
   - Add Contact.test.tsx covering recipient, subject, body and URL escaping.

2. Leftover from the logo commit
   - Remove public/favicon.svg, the purple #863bff bolt. It is referenced
     nowhere since index.html was repointed, so it was dead weight.
